 "name_en": "Initial Stock Upload for Warehouse (1FU)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Initial Stock Upload for Warehouse (1FU)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio589cc3f12701409db7fc3c7ff3fe6e32\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio589cc3f12701409db7fc3c7ff3fe6e32__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">In this scope item, you initially provide stock to bins of the different final storage types provided with the warehouse. It gives a good example how stock upload can be done and is also a simple and quick way to set the stage for testing.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">The stock data for the upload is provided via different sheets containing products and storage types. The upload creates handling units using an internal HU numbering instead of assigning Standard Shipping Container Codes (SSCC) as would be done in the basic inbound process. The upload always populates bins listed at the end of a storage type to avoid possible overlaps with bins occupied by standard processes.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio589cc3f12701409db7fc3c7ff3fe6e32__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Upload stock to the different storage types of the warehouse</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Check the material documents (optional)</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio589cc3f12701409db7fc3c7ff3fe6e32__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage stock on a storage bin level</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Demonstrates stock upload capabilities</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Provides storage type, product, and process-specific stock upload data for all supported processes in the usual stock upload file format</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>仓库的初始库存上载 (1FU)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio589cc3f12701409db7fc3c7ff3fe6e32\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio589cc3f12701409db7fc3c7ff3fe6e32__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">在此范围项目中，最初为仓库提供的不同最终存储类型的仓位提供库存。它提供了如何完成库存上载的良好示例，也是设置测试阶段的简单快捷方法。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">上载的库存数据通过包含产品和存储类型的不同工作表提供。上载使用内部处理单元编号创建处理单元，而不是像在基本内向流程中那样分配标准装运集装箱代码 (SSCC)。上载始终填充仓储类型结束时列出的仓位，以避免可能与标准流程占用的仓位重叠。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio589cc3f12701409db7fc3c7ff3fe6e32__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">将库存上载到仓库的不同存储类型。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">检查物料凭证（可选）</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio589cc3f12701409db7fc3c7ff3fe6e32__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">在仓位级别管理库存</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">演示库存上载功能</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">以常规库存上载文件格式为所有支持的流程提供存储类型、产品和流程特定的库存上载数据</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
